1
00:00:00,306 --> 00:00:01,476
(Penny:)No. No, not really.

2
00:00:01,641 --> 00:00:04,521
(Penny:)Listen, didn't you say
you needed some eggs?

3
00:00:04,686 --> 00:00:08,026
(Sheldon:)Yes, but anyone who knows anything
about bacterial growth...

4
00:00:08,189 --> 00:00:11,149
(Sheldon:)...knows to pick up their refrigerated foods
on the way out.

5
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:14,116
Oh, okay, maybe you should start
heading on out, then.

6
00:00:15,363 --> 00:00:17,363
(Sheldon:)No, this is fun.

7
00:00:17,532 --> 00:00:20,372
(Sheldon:)The thing about tomatoes,
and I think you'll enjoy this...

8
00:00:20,535 --> 00:00:23,785
(Sheldon:)...is they're shelved with the vegetables,
but they're technically a fruit.

9
00:00:23,955 --> 00:00:25,205
- Hmm. Interesting.
- Isn't it?

10
00:00:25,373 --> 00:00:28,043
(Penny:)No, I mean what you find enjoyable.

11
00:00:32,464 --> 00:00:33,504
(Sheldon(as Penny selects vitamin supplements):)Oh, boy.

12
00:00:35,383 --> 00:00:37,053
(Penny:)What now?

13
00:00:37,218 --> 00:00:39,758
(Sheldon:)Well, there's some value
to taking a multivitamin...

14
00:00:39,929 --> 00:00:42,139
(Sheldon:)...but the human body
can only absorb so much.

15
00:00:42,307 --> 00:00:47,187
(Sheldon:)What you're buying here
are the ingredients for very expensive urine.

16
00:00:47,896 --> 00:00:50,816
(Penny:)Well, maybe that's what I was going for.

17
00:00:50,982 --> 00:00:59,022
(Sheldon:)Well, then you'll want some manganese.

